# ===================================================================
# ECON 122 F26 — .gitignore
#
# REMEMBER: this repo IS the website. Tracked + pushed == public.
# This file is the security boundary. If a solution is NOT listed as
# ignored here, and you commit it, students can reach it by URL.
#
# Model (inherited from f25, with solutions tightened):
#   - Slides:     publish HTML only. Source (.Rmd) stays private.
#   - Activities: publish student .Rmd + rendered output.
#   - Solutions:  PRIVATE BY DEFAULT. Released one at a time, after
#                 the due date, by force-adding the specific file.
# ===================================================================

# --- R / RStudio cruft (never publish) ---
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.RDataTmp
.Ruserdata
*.rds
*.Rproj

# --- Slides: students get HTML, not source ---
slides/*.Rmd
slides/*.rmd

# --- SOLUTIONS: private by default (this is the key change from f25) ---
# All solution files are ignored so a stray `git add .` can never publish
# them. To release one after its due date, force-add just that file:
#     git add -f ps/ps1_sol.html
# then commit and push only that file.
*_sol.html
*_sol.Rmd
*_sol.rmd
*_sol.md
*_solution.*
activity/sol/
ps/*_sol.*

# --- Grading & answer keys: never publish ---
grading.Rmd
profit_calculator.R
*_results.csv
*optimal_parameters*
*optimization_results*
tp*/loan_*_with_outcomes.csv
tp*/*_full_instructor.csv

# --- Exams: never publish from this repo ---
exam*/
*_exam_sol.*
MT*_key.*

# --- Spreadsheets / misc ---
*.xls
*.xlsx
push_log.txt

# --- Internal planning docs: not ready for students yet ---
# Working schedule drafts, notes, etc. Fold confirmed pieces into
# README.md by hand (or ask) when ready to release them.
schedule_*_draft.csv
internal_notes.md
TODO.md
TODO.html
RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md
autograder_templates/

# --- Activities & problem sets: distributed via Classroom 50 template ---
# repos (separate GitHub repos, e.g. econ122-f26/day3-activity-template),
# not published from this site. Day 1 is the exception: async, pre-class
# setup with no submission, so it stays a direct link/file as before.
# ps/*.Rmd (student version, not just *_sol.*) is included here too, since
# problem sets never get committed to this repo at all under this model.
activity/*_activity.Rmd
!activity/day1_activity.Rmd
ps/*.Rmd
